WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:10,950
Found it, follow me

2
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:17,090
Great, enough is enough. Just use them to test the poison.

3
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:20,090
If they are fine eating vegetables, it means we can eat them too

4
00:00:20,090 --> 00:00:24,080
If they die, we'll find another way

5
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:27,400
The seeds of these vegetables may not be contaminated

6
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,560
Just find the seed wholesale market

7
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:32,560
In the future, you will be able to open a piece of land and grow normal vegetables.

8
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:36,560
That's right. When I get back, I'll look for an opportunity to browse the seed market.

9
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:39,560
It’s better to grow your own vegetables than these cheap vegetables.

10
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:50,630
Go to the other side and don't block the road. I'll deal with you in two days.
